WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.099 --> 00:00:06.440
Speaker 1: I want to start today by talking
about a new statement from the CDC about coronavirus

00:00:06.440 --> 00:00:12.770
vaccination of younger people and what appears
to be a link to a very rare heart condition,

00:00:12.770 --> 00:00:16.270
which can also be caused by the virus itself.

00:00:16.270 --> 00:00:23.160
And I think I feel driven to kind of preface
this by saying, on the one hand, I've been

00:00:23.160 --> 00:00:28.310
a huge advocate of vaccination and continue
to be and this doesn't change that.

00:00:28.310 --> 00:00:33.440
And so for people who will react to me talking
about this by saying, are you going anti vaccine?

00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:35.200
Absolutely not.

00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:39.190
The risks of this condition with the vaccine
are far lower than the risks of the very same

00:00:39.190 --> 00:00:40.190
condition.

00:00:40.190 --> 00:00:41.269
If you get covid.

00:00:41.269 --> 00:00:44.780
On the other hand, for people who have been
saying, David, you won't ever talk about the

00:00:44.780 --> 00:00:46.320
side effects of vaccines.

00:00:46.320 --> 00:00:50.949
Well, you're also wrong because I'm talking
about them right here.

00:00:50.949 --> 00:00:53.749
So let's get right into it.

00:00:53.749 --> 00:01:00.049
CDC safety group says there is a likely link
between rare heart inflammation in young people

00:01:00.049 --> 00:01:02.139
after covid shot.

00:01:02.139 --> 00:01:08.159
There have been more than 12 hundred cases
of a myocarditis or pericarditis, mostly in

00:01:08.159 --> 00:01:14.520
30 and under people who received Fyssas or
Moderne as covid-19 vaccine.

00:01:14.520 --> 00:01:21.170
According to CDC data, roughly 300 million
shots had been administered as of June 11th.

00:01:21.170 --> 00:01:29.130
For both vaccines combined, there were 12
heart inflammation cases per million doses.

00:01:29.130 --> 00:01:34.810
The CDC safety group is calling it a likely
association between this rare heart inflammatory

00:01:34.810 --> 00:01:39.619
condition in adolescents and young adults,
mostly after they've received their second

00:01:39.619 --> 00:01:43.430
shot based on the most recent data available.

00:01:43.430 --> 00:01:50.200
Twelve hundred cases, according to a series
of presentations published yesterday Wednesday.

00:01:50.200 --> 00:01:53.260
Myocarditis is the inflammation of the heart
muscle.

00:01:53.260 --> 00:01:56.990
Pericarditis is the inflammation of the membrane
surrounding the heart.

00:01:56.990 --> 00:02:02.590
Doctor Grassley chairs the CDC safety group,
says, quote, Clinical presentation of myocarditis.

00:02:02.590 --> 00:02:07.659
Cases following vaccination has been distinct,
occurring most often within one week after

00:02:07.659 --> 00:02:14.970
dose two with chest pain as the most common
presentation, information is being gathered

00:02:14.970 --> 00:02:20.120
about how to manage this, the agency said
there have been two hundred and sixty seven

00:02:20.120 --> 00:02:25.350
cases of myocarditis or pericarditis after
one dose and eight hundred and twenty seven

00:02:25.350 --> 00:02:31.650
after two doses, one hundred and thirty two
additional cases where doses received is unknown.

00:02:31.650 --> 00:02:38.660
Importantly, Dr. Tom Shimabukuro says this
is still a rare event.

00:02:38.660 --> 00:02:41.010
It's mostly men under 30.

00:02:41.010 --> 00:02:46.740
Remember, the blood clotting with the JMJ
was mostly women under 45.

00:02:46.740 --> 00:02:49.240
This is mostly men under 30.

00:02:49.240 --> 00:02:52.840
Very important of the two hundred and ninety
five people who developed the condition and

00:02:52.840 --> 00:02:54.600
have been discharged.

00:02:54.600 --> 00:03:01.030
Seventy nine percent fully recovered, nine
were hospitalized, two in intensive care.

00:03:01.030 --> 00:03:03.310
So there's no reason to hide this.

00:03:03.310 --> 00:03:09.990
We want to understand the risks and understand
any medication, treatment or whatever that

00:03:09.990 --> 00:03:11.960
that we are obtaining.

00:03:11.960 --> 00:03:16.130
When you look at these numbers, you're talking
about two out of three hundred million doses

00:03:16.130 --> 00:03:18.210
to people in intensive care.

00:03:18.210 --> 00:03:24.370
And so we should be aware of this as vaccination
sites are told about this and develop protocol

00:03:24.370 --> 00:03:25.670
for managing it.

00:03:25.670 --> 00:03:30.980
This is why you have all of this data and
do this research.

00:03:30.980 --> 00:03:35.660
The vaccine is still way safer at all ages
than getting covid.

00:03:35.660 --> 00:03:37.790
That's an important thing to remember.

00:03:37.790 --> 00:03:41.130
We now know I know personally of people of
a variety of ages.

00:03:41.130 --> 00:03:43.730
Twenty five plus dying of covid.

00:03:43.730 --> 00:03:48.460
I know of one person with an allergic reaction
to the vaccine.

00:03:48.460 --> 00:03:49.590
That was sort of serious.

00:03:49.590 --> 00:03:53.730
She was brought to the E.R. and was fine after
a couple of hours.

00:03:53.730 --> 00:03:56.160
There's no reason to hide this stuff.

00:03:56.160 --> 00:03:57.840
It looks bad to hide it.

00:03:57.840 --> 00:04:00.050
It should be reported in proper context.

00:04:00.050 --> 00:04:07.000
And remember that covid itself comes with
risk of heart inflammation, and it's a really

00:04:07.000 --> 00:04:09.600
important thing to remember.

00:04:09.600 --> 00:04:12.440
So information is still being gathered about
this.

00:04:12.440 --> 00:04:15.300
It's extraordinarily rare.

00:04:15.300 --> 00:04:22.550
And even in almost all cases where this rare
thing happens, people make a full recovery.

00:04:22.550 --> 00:04:26.990
Those are the facts as we understand them
right now.

00:04:26.990 --> 00:04:30.660
And as more information comes forward about
this, of course, I will present it to you.

